    <briefdescription>
<para>B-spline cell geometry (one knot span), a geometry policy for the MPM cells. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Wraps <ref refid="class_marmot_1_1_discretizations_1_1_elements_1_1_b_spline_geometry_element" kindref="compound">Marmot::Discretizations::Elements::BSplineGeometryElement</ref> for use as the <computeroutput>GeometryCell</computeroutput> of a cell (see <ref refid="concept_marmot_1_1_discretizations_1_1_cells_1_1_geometry_cell_policy" kindref="compound">GeometryCellPolicy</ref>). The cell is the knot span <formula id="52">$ [u_{p}, u_{p+1}] $</formula> of each direction; the knot vectors are given in <bold>physical coordinates</bold>, so the parametric coordinate of a point is the point itself: <ref refid="class_marmot_1_1_discretizations_1_1_cells_1_1_b_spline_cell_geometry_1ab5a838f4a312e258e26375337822201f" kindref="member">findReferenceCoordinate()</ref> is the identity and <ref refid="class_marmot_1_1_discretizations_1_1_cells_1_1_b_spline_cell_geometry_1a25ea7919ab76d1b6553b2b40c515b891" kindref="member">dNdX()</ref> returns the parametric derivatives unchanged. This is exact for a B-spline grid whose geometry map is the identity <formula id="53">$ \boldsymbol{X}(\boldsymbol{\xi}) = \boldsymbol{\xi} $</formula> (control points at the Greville abscissae, e.g. a uniform, axis-aligned background grid); the control point coordinates enter only <ref refid="class_marmot_1_1_discretizations_1_1_cells_1_1_b_spline_cell_geometry_1a524cf87de72ec96da9b120001e1ee868" kindref="member">detJ()</ref>.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>nDim</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Spatial dimension (2 or 3). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>order</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Polynomial degree <formula id="54">$ p $</formula> (1, 2 or 3 are registered). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
